flowchart TD
    Observe[Observe current call, walk-in, message and notebook workflow] --> Qualify[Qualify merchant, owner, device and pilot fit]
    Qualify --> Configure[Template-led minimal setup + upcoming booking reconciliation]
    Configure --> Practice[Demo: manual, customer, offline, conflict, payment states]
    Practice --> Activate[Owner preview and controlled activation]
    Activate --> Shadow[Short shadow period + named support]
    Shadow --> Review{Accurate value with acceptable help/cost?}
    Review -- Improve --> Configure
    Review -- Continue --> Operate[Normal pilot operations]
    Review -- Stop --> Exit[Export, obligations, disconnect, retention/deletion]
    Operate --> Case[One support case: verify, classify, safe workaround]
    Case --> Escalate[Product / incident / integration / payment / privacy runbook]
    Escalate --> Verify[Reconcile, verify, revoke access, learn]
    Verify --> Operate

